  {
   "id": "spirit-hunter-death-mark-ii-133814@patch-2024-03-01",
   "gameId": "spirit-hunter-death-mark-ii-133814",
   "displayName": "Fixes for patch 29/02/2024",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-03-01T09:55:36.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "The following issues have been fixed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1) In the infirmary, if you press \"talk\" and then hide the dialogue box and click anywhere on screen the dialogue will end as expected, however the next time press the talk feature the game freezes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) Chapter 2 endgame: I selected Spirit File while the \"Hanako may appear at any moment\" banner at the bottom was active and got a black screen that doesn't respond...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Entering the gameplay and proceeding to the help menu to check the controls, it is observed that a blank screen is displayed upon opening 'Controls - 1' and 'Controls - 2'.”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
